      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.44.0"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "ONE WORKFLOW / NATIVE SIZE\n\nUpload 1920x1080. Leave crop width/height at 0 for the full frame.\nOptional crop: set the rectangle BEFORE SeedVR2. Use even dimensions and keep the subject inside it for the entire shot.\n\n1920x1080 SOURCE: width x height, x, y\nFull frame: 0 x 0, 0, 0\nSquare LEFT: 1080 x 1080, 0, 0\nSquare CENTER: 1080 x 1080, 420, 0\nSquare RIGHT: 1080 x 1080, 840, 0\n2:3 LEFT: 720 x 1080, 0, 0\n2:3 CENTER: 720 x 1080, 600, 0\n2:3 RIGHT: 720 x 1080, 1200, 0\nCustom: choose x/y/width/height. Do not crop outside the source.\n\nThe automatic short edge keeps the cropped resolution; no forced 4K, stretching or source blend.\nStandard 7B is the baseline. Sharp 7B FP16 is optional in the SAME model dropdown; it can invent more texture.\nCompare PNG: source LEFT, restored RIGHT. Judge the finished video in motion too.\n\nThe whole selected clip occupies RAM. Batch 9 is temporal inference, not a 9-frame clip cap.\nFirst Run downloads the selected model + VAE. Progress/logs/save/download are native ComfyUI."
      ]
    }
